# Released packages that make up the current ROS2 PAR Framework.
# Those are installed instead of cloned from a repository. See nodes.list for the nodes
# that do not have a release, e.g. custom framework nodes and apps.
#
# One rosdep key per line: usually the ROS package name, e.g. realsense2_camera for
# ros-<distro>-realsense2-camera. rosdep picks the right apt package for the sourced distro.
# Find a key with: rosdep resolve <key>
#
# Every package listed here is installed by scripts/local_build.sh, like the repositories in
# nodes.list. Comment out what your setup does not use.

# Sensors:

v4l2_camera               # generic UVC webcam (camera: webcam)
realsense2_camera         # RealSense depth camera support
